   "text": "AI INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANIES (HIRING LIST)\n\nHere are 35 AI infrastructure companies that are actively hiring right now, ranked by percentage headcount growth in the past 90 days. This is Week 83 of On My Radar, my weekly list of the companies I can't stop watching:\n\nSambaNova - AI chips and cloud (San Jose)\nTYLsemi - chiplet silicon for AI (San Jose)\nDapple - dedicated enterprise AI infrastructure (Dublin)\nHighreso Co., Ltd. - GPU cloud (Tokyo)\nNscale - full-stack AI cloud (Norway)\nVolta - vertically integrated AI infrastructure (Palo Alto)\nModal - serverless inference and training (New York)\nPositron AI - inference hardware (Reno)\nRunpod - AI developer cloud (San Francisco)\nFractile - infere",
