   "text": "Jane Street set Etched's $21 billion valuation in August. It is also the chip startup's only named customer.\n\nThe mark quadrupled in eight months. Etched says it holds more than $1 billion in customer contracts, but the figure is company-stated and unaudited, and a contract here can be a real order or just a letter of intent.\n\nJane Street had already put in more than $100 million and sat in both earlier rounds. Its rack has been running live workloads since July.\n\nCommercial racks are due in the fourth quarter. Until a buyer with no equity signs, the order book and the cap table are the same list.\n\n#Etched #JaneStreet #AIChips #Nvidia #VentureCapital\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/g25vMeR6\n\n#Etched #JaneS",
